.SH NAME
cw \- cw backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cw
\fI\,backup \/\fR[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IP
Backup the CW database to a timestamped folder.
.IP
Creates a new subfolder with the current date and time, copies the database
and config into it.
.IP
The backup directory can be configured during install or with: cw config
\fB\-\-backup\-dir\fR \fI\,/path/to/backups\/\fP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-target\fR TEXT
